{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion","id":1219641,"title":"Pro Wrestling in Scion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-17T07:54:20-07:00","id":1219641,"title":"Pro Wrestling in Scion","content":"I pre-ordered Scion and while waiting for it's release i thought up a Storyline involving pro wrestling. Though this has me wondering, what would pro wrestling be like in a world where Myth and the Gods of old exist and how could it make for interesting adventures gor Scions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T08:06:42-07:00","id":1219649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion#post1219641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I pre-ordered Scion and while waiting for it's release i thought up a Storyline involving pro wrestling. Though this has me wondering, what would pro wrestling be like in a world where Myth and the Gods of old exist and how could it make for interesting adventures gor Scions?</div> </div> </div> </div>I could definitely see a WWE-like organization existing that is made up of nothing but Scions and other creatures of Legend. With divine powers in the mix, the violence could be very real, just not geared toward killing or maiming anyone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T09:20:40-07:00","id":1219673,"title":"","content":"Shot live from the Colosseum, where the same events were held thousands of years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T11:37:36-07:00","id":1219726,"title":"","content":"A pro werestling show dedicated to the Greco-Roman gods in the Colosseum sounds pretty cool. I wonder what other parthenons would enjoy seeing people get their heads bashed by chairs or powerslammed through tables in a show dedicated to them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12186,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","user":"Killerclown","date":". 05-17-2018, 02:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T13:11:50-07:00","id":1219757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion?p=1219726#post1219726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A pro werestling show dedicated to the Greco-Roman gods in the Colosseum sounds pretty cool. I wonder what other parthenons would enjoy seeing people get their heads bashed by chairs or powerslammed through tables in a show dedicated to them?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Aesir and the Tuatha are always up for a good scrap, so they'd probably love being involved. The Orisha seem to really appreciate good fighters and athletes, so I could see them being interested. The Teotl love a good fight too, and this kind of entertainment would be somewhat similar to ritual forms of combat they practiced back in the day, just without the whole &quot;sacrifice the losing team at the end&quot; thing. The Manitou don't seem to be a particularly warlike Pantheon, but as I understand it, a lot of Native American tribes were quite fond of forms of warfare that didn't necessarily result in death. The Shen and the Kami are both quite fond of displays of martial arts prowess. I could see Scions of Takemikazuchi being quite fond of bringing sumo wrestling to the sport. I'm sure the Netjer and the Deva would have their own warriors who'd like to be involved too.<br /> <br /> You can pretty much make a case that just about any of the Pantheons would have at least some interest in being involved. Pantheon pride, if nothing else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T16:25:43-07:00","id":1219818,"title":"","content":"Consider: Scion Luchadores","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T20:05:16-07:00","id":1219864,"title":"","content":"Actually, Scion Luchadores was the first thing i thought up of when i pictured Scion pro wrestlers. I can totally see the Aztec scions being involved in this kind of sport. Good suggestions with the other pantheons unnatural. My idea for the promotion itself is that the non-scion wrestlers and the Scion and Mythical monsters are put in two categories. Normal is called Face or Heel, Mythical and Divine are called Mega Face or Mega Heels. Megas and normals usually don't wrestle each other unless it is a tag team match. Though, i do wonder what would keep a scion from accidentally killing a normal human wrestler in a match?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12186,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","user":"Killerclown","date":". 05-17-2018, 11:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-18T14:46:38-07:00","id":1220095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion?p=1219864#post1219864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Though, i do wonder what would keep a scion from accidentally killing a normal human wrestler in a match?</div> </div> </div> </div>Career suicide due to an obvious lack of self-control?<br /> <br /> Granted I can see a lot of fun events and matches. Like a bunch of Faces join forces to beat Dark Mirror, a Mega Heel Scion of Tezcatlipoca (Ironically the wrestler himself is a swell dude, he just plays up his stage persona) in a match called &quot;Defying the Mountain&quot; or something.<br /> <br /> Or a bunch of Heels take out some Faces, brag to the audience about how it's THEIR ring now, but then who should arrive but the Mega Face Olympus, Scion of Zeus, here to save the day.<br /> <br /> The tickets would sell like mad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":2142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","user":"Kyman201","date":". 05-20-2018, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T22:05:02-07:00","id":1220438,"title":"","content":"Good suggestions. Also, now i am picturing this Olympus character later getting ambushed by a heel wrestler whose gimmick is that of a feral man. One other i had is for the faces and heels to be part of two different factions where the mega wrestlers act like the leaders. I wonder what would be fitting faction names for both the face and heel factions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T07:55:58-07:00","id":1220539,"title":"","content":"Lucha Underground is, to me, basically a live-action character generator for Scion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12598-karasu-sama","name":"Karasu-sama","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T12:39:25-07:00","id":1220607,"title":"","content":"Great. Now I want to watch Pro Wrestling again. I thought I'd gotten that monkey off my back in the 90s. Thanks a lot, Scion-forum-I-usually-only-lurk-in. Seriously, thanks. I looked up Lucha Underground and it's almost bursting at the seams with drama and over the top theatrics, which is cool in my book. (I even broke out my copy of Mexico City by Night just to reminisce about the vampire luchadors. Good times.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-20T17:18:55-07:00","id":1220664,"title":"","content":"(Here is a link to what part of wrestling i am about to talk about in case you don't know what it is. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manager_(professional_wrestling\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manage...onal_wrestling</a>))<br /> <br /> Another idea for this promotion is that there are 10 managers, five heel and five face. The heels managers often play dirty to help their clients win, regardless if their opponents a regular face or a mega-face. Regardless of alignment, if a manager is given a mega wrestler as a client, there is a good chance that they will be under direct pressure to make them winners, mostly from fear of getting struck down by that scion's parent if they fail, especially if they are Theoi. But, a heel manager has a even bigger risk, pissing off the Scion themselves. Because, Heel managers often interfere in matches to help their clients win when the official is not looking. If the Scion catches them or if the scion wins, you can fill in the blanks what the scion can do to them. Though, i do wonder what kind of non-lethal temporary punishments Scions from different pantheons can dish up for a interfering manager, besides a beating?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-21T19:41:52-07:00","id":1221039,"title":"","content":"Now i am wondering what a Scion of Coyote would be like as a pro wrestler.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T17:44:16-07:00","id":1221325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion?p=1221039#post1221039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now i am wondering what a Scion of Coyote would be like as a pro wrestler.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like Ric Flair in his prime, the heel who will pull out every dirty trick in the book (and some that aren't) to win, and is still loved for it. And who has absolutely no reservations of doing what Shawn Michaels did to Hulk Hogan at SummerSlam '05 if you piss him off. <br /> <br /> Pro-wrestling is apparently a growing thing in India as well. Also has a fairly big following in the UK. As far as Pantheons, the various Celtic ones, the Aesir, the Greco-Romans, the Kami and the Aztecs would be the really big ones, I think. Probably also the Polynesian/Samoans. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T18:38:49-07:00","id":1221344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion?p=1221325#post1221325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Like Ric Flair in his prime, the heel who will pull out every dirty trick in the book (and some that aren't) to win, and is still loved for it. And who has absolutely no reservations of doing what Shawn Michaels did to Hulk Hogan at SummerSlam '05 if you piss him off. <br /> <br /> Pro-wrestling is apparently a growing thing in India as well. Also has a fairly big following in the UK. As far as Pantheons, the various Celtic ones, the Aesir, the Greco-Romans, the Kami and the Aztecs would be the really big ones, I think. Probably also the Polynesian/Samoans. <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Considering the culture, Eddie Guerrero (RIP) would be a great example as well. Eddie's cheating was meant to be funny, charming, and just flat-out entertaining. I could see s Scion of Coyote taking a similar approach.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">&quot;We have done the impossible, and that makes us mighty.&quot;<br /> Captain Malcolm Reynolds</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/679-unnatural1","name":"unnatural1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T21:15:37-07:00","id":1221372,"title":"","content":"This is all a really interesting idea, but seems like it might be a good way to end up with some undesirable fatebinding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T06:18:39-07:00","id":1222227,"title":"","content":"I forgot about Fatebinding. That would make Scions kinda rare then. Now i am wondering how legendary creatures like Oni could work as pro wrestlers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-27T11:22:53-07:00","id":1222472,"title":"","content":"Yeah. I mean, celebrity is a common enough thing for Scions, but kayfabe means that the average scion playing a face or a heel is going to run into a little trouble. I mean, as mere Scions it's not that bad; unless your deeds as Scion don't follow you to Demigod-hood and beyond, playing a heel in the ring is going to catch up to you eventually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-28T18:59:12-07:00","id":1222780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion?p=1222472#post1222472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah. I mean, celebrity is a common enough thing for Scions, but kayfabe means that the average scion playing a face or a heel is going to run into a little trouble. I mean, as mere Scions it's not that bad; unless your deeds as Scion don't follow you to Demigod-hood and beyond, playing a heel in the ring is going to catch up to you eventually.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bYeah, I can see your point. If a Scion does decided to sign up as a wrestler, I can see most of them choosing to be a Face to avoid turning into a evil monster. I wonder how the rare few that sign up to be a heel can avoid faterbinding fucking them up to bad when it inevitably happens One scion wrestler I had was a female Scion of Amaterasu who happens to be heel. Her gimmick is basically her thinking she is some kind of divine noble because her mother happens to be the head of the Kami pantheon, which she actually kinda thinks is true outside the ring. As a result, she is portrayed as thinking herself to be Queen off the Heel locker room with all the non-mega heels under her beck and call. You can see why the mortal heels would probably want to listen to her. I wonder how badly fatebinding could affect her?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-11T11:07:48-07:00","id":1226512,"title":"","content":"Combine mantles, full luchador, and a little bit of God of Magic. Have Fate Bindings attach to the mask. When the binding starts to get bothersome, retire and hand the mask to your (much less powerful/legendy) protege. Dunno if rules legal, but I would make it so passing the mask gives the new Luchador a little power buff to help fill the role, while weakening the fatebinding from &quot;nasty and destructive&quot; to &quot;the heel gets his karma, but survives to do a heel face turn&quot;.<br /> <br /> And I would want the fatebinding to mostly affect in the ring, with enough outside to protect kayfabe (one kayfabe break I remember was a heel and a face going to restaurants together. tsk tsk). Actually, depending how stories and fame affect Fate, I could see Fate start to enforce this structure, cause it's how all the stories go.<br /> <br /> This does bring up a broader point, given a couple background assumptions for the &quot;gods didn't go into hiding for 2000 years&quot; scenario. First, if you have Zeus, Satyrs, and gods with similar... proclivities, you end up with a lot more children, halfbloods, and other offspring than you have visitations. (I assume a god has a limited amount of time &amp; limited number of relics, and also plenty of paranoia: too many new Scions at once leads to fights, betrayal, and old gods getting kicked out. This ends up with a lot of mostly-humans who might have powers to go at it on a Hero level, but can't make the jump to Demi.) Now combine that with the sheer number of Gods of testosterone poisoning.<br /> <br /> Enter: the GAMES and the divine talent scout. Whether it is the Olympics, Cold Cash War style war games, or pro wrestling - they are all ways to vent some steam, do rituals (if there is god who 'needz blud badly' you dedicate all the injuries to them), and generally show off in socially acceptable ways. Pluuus for the gods: would you rather visit one of your many children, make them Scions almost sight unseen, and hope things go well, or go to the GAMES and Visit an unknown-parentage Scion who excels in the areas you like? The non-scions who can still compete at this level can make good followers or retainers. So one part cool reality show, one part cheering stadium, one part valhalla prep.<br /> <br /> Plus, you can use something like the Chinese civil service exam or Miss America as the same thing for non-fighty Gods. Add in underground illegal fight clubs, World Martial Arts Tournament, and Maker Faire. Hephestaus might not want to take the time away from his forge to sire a kid, when he can sponsor &quot;Forged in Fire&quot; and take a winner on as his apprentice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2678-spoonr","name":"SpoonR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2678_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-11T18:19:04-07:00","id":1226627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1219641-pro-wrestling-in-scion?p=1222227#post1222227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I forgot about Fatebinding. That would make Scions kinda rare then. Now i am wondering how legendary creatures like Oni could work as pro wrestlers.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Considering that a core part of their mythology involves them being excessively strong, I imagine they'd make excellent sumo wrestlers.<br /> <br /> Lifting, shoving and throwing 400 pound men around the ring is not something most athletes would be equipped to handle. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /